{"id":"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-language-operations.md","title":"Closure Properties of Regular Languages","display":"thm-regular-language-closure — Closure Properties of Regular Languages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-language-operations","aliases":["73-thm-regular-language-operations","73-thm-regular-language-closure"],"display":"thm-regular-language-closure — Closure Properties of Regular Languages","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-language-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-language-operations</span><span>73-thm-regular-language-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-language-closure — Closure Properties of Regular Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (regular languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L_1\\cap L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land\\Sigma^*\\setminus L_1\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L_1\\setminus L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L_1\\cap L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land\\Sigma^*\\setminus L_1\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L_1\\setminus L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cdot L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cdot L_2\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1^*\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1^*\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\{w^R:w\\in L_1\\}\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}language\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\{w^R:w\\in L_1\\}\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Product automata prove union and intersection; complement swaps final and nonfinal states in a total DFA, and difference follows by intersection.</li>\n<li>Epsilon-NFA constructions prove concatenation and star; reversing every edge and swapping the initial/final interface proves reversal.</li>\n<li>Concatenation and star use the language operations fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>, including the explicit empty-product clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(L_1^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":fa